              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ipapo akazorora namadzibaba ake uye akavigwa muguta raDhavhidhi baba vake. Uye Rehobhoamu mwanakomana wake akamutevera paumambo.",
          "type": "text",
